# Build artifacts
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.exe

# Assembly output
# *.list
# *.lst
*.map
*.sym
*.img

# Flash Cart images. The 32K .crt of each cartridge project is committed so a
# reader can look at what it produces; a 1 MB image of mostly $FF is not worth
# the same. `make all-flash` in the project rebuilds them. The -VDP builds are
# covered too, because the target comes last in the name. Named by extension
# rather than as *-128K.* so that 6502-128K.cfg, which is source, is not swept
# up with them.
*-128K.crt
*-128K.lst
*-128K.map
*-256K.crt
*-256K.lst
*-256K.map
*-512K.crt
*-512K.lst
*-512K.map
*-1M.crt
*-1M.lst
*-1M.map

# Backup and temporary files
*~
*.bak
*.tmp
*.swp
*.swo

# IDE and editor files
.vscode/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

